--   An intermediate lemma of the split of OpenAI's proof of `OAI.sharp_fourier_certificate`, carved from OpenAI's openai/math development for this platform. The statement and its proof are OpenAI's (OpenAI, *A sharp Fourier certificate for planar circle packing (result family 090)*, OpenAI Math Release, September 23, 2026, result family 90, [github.com/openai/math](https://github.com/openai/math), Apache License 2.0); in Lean it is the declaration `OAI.SharpPlanar.tableMomentK_eq` of [lean/OAI/Analysis/PlanarPacking/TableKBridge.lean](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/7ef5c0cc5ca4b0e072b7a050fca09ab24bc6fa3a/lean/OAI/Analysis/PlanarPacking/TableKBridge.lean) at commit 7ef5c0c, ported to Lean 4.33.1 and Mathlib 0df444a.
--
--   **The statement**, as published (namespace `OAI.SharpPlanar`, with `open MeasureTheory`, `open scoped BigOperators`):
--
--   ```lean
--   lemma tableMomentK_eq_g (a : Bool) (m : ℝ) (ell : ℕ) :
--       tableMomentK a m ell=K (tableData a) ell m/(ell.factorial:ℝ)
--   ```
